    {
      "id": "secrets-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 1005,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "SIGNING_SECRET (HMAC-SHA256) ------> Lambda Env Vars / AWS Secrets Manager (condiviso OAuth + API Lambda)\nOAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET ----------------> Lambda Env Vars / AWS Secrets Manager (solo OAuth Lambda)\nOAUTH_CLIENT_ID --------------------> Lambda Env Vars + Frontend config (pubblico, non segreto)\nEXPORTER_TOKEN ---------------------> Lambda Env Vars / AWS Secrets Manager (solo Cronjob Exporter)\nNessun segreto hardcoded nel codice. IAM Roles per accesso DynamoDB (no credenziali esplicite).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#862e9c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 50,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": "secrets-box",
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "originalText": "SIGNING_SECRET (HMAC-SHA256) ------> Lambda Env Vars / AWS Secrets Manager (condiviso OAuth + API Lambda)\nOAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET ----------------> Lambda Env Vars / AWS Secrets Manager (solo OAuth Lambda)\nOAUTH_CLIENT_ID --------------------> Lambda Env Vars + Frontend config (pubblico, non segreto)\nEXPORTER_TOKEN ---------------------> Lambda Env Vars / AWS Secrets Manager (solo Cronjob Exporter)\nNessun segreto hardcoded nel codice. IAM Roles per accesso DynamoDB (no credenziali esplicite)."
    },
